{{~!--
    Branded series registry (#100). The one place that maps tag slugs to homepage branding.

    Adding a series = one line in each mode below + a `.wc-brand--<slug>` token block in
    screen.css (Series brands). Handlebars can't read CSS, and custom settings are flat strings
    capped at 20 by Ghost, so this list can't live in Admin.

    Tags are matched by SLUG via the post's tag loop, not `{{#has tag=…}}`: `has` matches the
    tag's NAME, which is editable in Admin and would silently drop the colour on a rename.

    Modes (call from a post context, or pass position/riverSize for slots):
    - card-class  → " wc-brand--<slug>" for each branded tag on the post. When a post has two,
                    both classes print and CSS source order decides: luminous wins.
    - card-badge  → the pinned cards' tab badge (Tag name, linked to the series page), in the
                    card's series colours. Luminous prints first, so a post in two series shows
                    the badge that matches its colours; CSS hides any second badge.
    - slot        → the pinned card for slot `position` (1–3), or nothing.
                    Positions: 1 newsletter (after river card 2), 2 Island of Knowledge
                    (after card 4), 3 Luminous (after card 6).
--~}}
{{~#match mode "card-class"}}{{#foreach tags}}{{#match slug "island-of-knowledge"}} wc-brand--island-of-knowledge{{/match}}{{#match slug "luminous"}} wc-brand--luminous{{/match}}{{/foreach}}{{/match~}}
{{~#match mode "card-badge"}}{{#foreach tags}}{{#match slug "luminous"}}<a class="wc-highlight-badge wc-series-badge" href="/luminous/">{{name}}</a>{{/match}}{{/foreach}}{{#foreach tags}}{{#match slug "island-of-knowledge"}}<a class="wc-highlight-badge wc-series-badge" href="/island-of-knowledge/">{{name}}</a>{{/match}}{{/foreach}}{{/match~}}
{{~#match mode "slot"}}
    {{#match position "==" 1}}{{> "series/slot" pinFilter="tag:newsletter+featured:true" slug="newsletter" url="/newsletter/" accentClass="wc-highlight--newsletter" always=true}}{{/match}}
    {{#match position "==" 2}}{{> "series/slot" pinFilter="tag:island-of-knowledge+featured:true" slug="island-of-knowledge" url="/island-of-knowledge/" accentClass="wc-highlight--series" riverSize=riverSize}}{{/match}}
    {{#match position "==" 3}}{{> "series/slot" pinFilter="tag:luminous+featured:true" slug="luminous" url="/luminous/" accentClass="wc-highlight--luminous" riverSize=riverSize}}{{/match}}
{{/match~}}
